 partial if the cap is reached). Target: >=40 wrong-majority held-out tasks
 (oracle@K>vote@1) and a meaningfully larger positive_candidate_n than .392's
 20. Report arc_pool_grown (BARE bool) + positive_candidate_n +
 wrong_majority_n + held_out_task_n + pool_artifact_path. NO TRM training;
 READ-ONLY w.r.t. the TRM checkpoint.

